# Prompt templates directory
#
# Versioned LLM prompt templates live here.
# Each prompt is a separate file so it can be:
#   - Reviewed and edited without touching Python code
#   - Tested independently with different inputs
#   - Version-controlled to track how prompt changes affect output
#
# Naming convention:
#   {purpose}_prompt.txt    e.g. plan_prompt.txt, code_gen_prompt.txt
#
# Phase 1: plan_prompt.txt (added in Task 7)
# Phase 2: code_gen_prompt.txt, test_gen_prompt.txt, fix_prompt.txt

